	(text "The power rail only supplying the MCU is being monitored for its current consumption.\nSpikes in the consumption will be used to locate BLE_TX and BLE_RX Events. \nThese Events are then used to synchronize the timestamp with the sensors.\n\n1 Ω Shunt Resistor + 50 V-Gain at 1V8 load -> Ezurio reports 24 mA max. current for BLE (+7dBm TX)\n-> Vout​ = 0.025 A * 1 Ω * 50 V (Gain) = 1.25 V\n-> max. readable current ~36 mA -> whole range is covered and good trade off with resolution"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 176.53 157.734 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.1588)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "f4cab8c2-01e2-49fc-93d9-077f1b93668b")
	)
